{"id":"c80d17d6e6a147a9","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-varelimrec.md","title":"Iterated elimination for Boolean zero equations","display":"thm-varelimrec — Iterated elimination for Boolean zero equations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-varelimrec","aliases":["27-thm-varelimrec"],"display":"thm-varelimrec — Iterated elimination for Boolean zero equations","depends_on":["[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§2.6 Theorem 2.6 and successive-variable-elimination discussion","source_printed_pages":"87–88","source_pdf_pages":"111–112","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-simultaneous-version-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-varelimrec"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-varelimrec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-varelimrec — Iterated elimination for Boolean zero equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.6 Theorem 2.6 and successive-variable-elimination discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"87–88"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"111–112"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-simultaneous-version-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq[n]\">\\(I\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J=[n]\\setminus I\">\\(J=[n]\\setminus I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B^I\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B^I\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^J\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\cup y\">\\(b\\cup y\\)</span> 是定义域不交的两个函数之并，属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B^n\">\\(\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elim}_I\">\\(\\mathrm{Elim}_I\\)</span> 是下式定义的同时消元函数构造符号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elim}_I(f)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,\\prod_{b\\in\\mathbb B^I}f(b\\cup y)\\right)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Elim}_I(f)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,\\prod_{b\\in\\mathbb B^I}f(b\\cup y)\\right)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\;\\left(\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B^I\\;(f(b\\cup y)=0)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Elim}_I(f)(y)=0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\;\\left(\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B^I\\;(f(b\\cup y)=0)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Elim}_I(f)(y)=0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限布尔标量的乘积等于 0 当且仅当至少一个因子为 0；B^I 总非空，包括 I 为空时的单元素情形。不同坐标消元的次序只重排有限乘积，结果相同。旧式对定义域为 B^J 的 cofactor 调用了只在 BoolFunc_k 上定义的无下标逐点合取；现在直接给标量乘积的函数图，不隐含重编号或函数空间同一化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-boolfunc]]；$I\\subseteq[n]$，$J=[n]\\setminus I$，$b\\in\\mathbb B^I$，$y\\in\\mathbb B^J$。$b\\cup y$ 是定义域不交的两个函数之并，属于 $\\mathbb B^n$。$\\mathrm{Elim}_I$ 是下式定义的同时消元函数构造符号。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"J=[n]\\setminus I","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B^I","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in\\mathbb B^J","display":false},{"tex":"b\\cup y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elim}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elim}_I(f)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,\\prod_{b\\in\\mathbb B^I}f(b\\cup y)\\right)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^J\\;\\left(\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B^I\\;(f(b\\cup y)=0)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\mathrm{Elim}_I(f)(y)=0\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1755,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-588","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-varelimrec|thm-varelimrec — Iterated elimination for Boolean zero equations]]"}],"outgoing":["5d10aed668d85817"]}